   *
   * Two modeling levels, both labeled:
   *   1. Function level: the returned expression inside each labeled
   *      InputSource method is a source node; global taint tracking
   *      propagates it to the value of every call of that method
   *      (e.g. Spec.py:114 `self.inputSource.read()`).
   *   2. Primitive level: the underlying sys.stdin.readlines /
